      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Five major aqueducts—Aqua Marcia, Aqua Tepula, Aqua Iulia, Aqua Claudia, and Anio Novus—crisscross Tuscolano, dating back to 144 BC.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
